+#Method void drawColor(SkColor color, SkBlendMode mode = SkBlendMode::kSrcOver)
+
+Fill Clip with Color color.
+mode determines how Color_ARGB is combined with destination.
+
+#Param color    Unpremultiplied Color_ARGB ##
