+#Method SkPath()
+
+By default, Path has no Verbs, no Points, and no Weights.
+Fill_Type is set to kWinding_FillType.
+
+#Return  empty Path ##
+
+#Example
+    SkPath path;
+    SkDebugf("path is " "%s" "empty", path.isEmpty() ? "" : "not ");
+#StdOut
+path is empty
